    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "entry": "生命依存说明完成：[形成、保留与实际不足](theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/LIVING-DEPENDENCIES.md)将维护、休眠／恢复及变化中的共同供给接成一般机制说明；最新14项 Lean 定理／19项审计通过，完整目标的独立审查接受。完成范围保留真实对应与条件；所有可能生命必然反复更新及普遍伦理仍未证明。 / The general living-dependencies account is complete at its declared scope, integrating maintenance, retention/recovery and changing joint provision. Fourteen new theorems and nineteen audits pass; independent completion review accepts the combined account. Universal recurrence and ethical grounding remain open.",
      "entry_sha256": "f0ee7d1fe2c69257602842da249585c064d8f70e3ba9e87f610a8a54cdcc7c65"
    },
    {
      "path": "RESEARCH.md",
      "entry": "**Living dependencies: general account completed, 8 October 2026.** [The completed synthesis and full-goal audit](_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/LIVING-DEPENDENCY-INTEGRATION.md#12-full-goal-completion-audit) connect maintenance under interaction, retained organization and recovery, and expanding or changing joint provision. The new arbitrary current-assignment proof derives a provision bound and locates an actual prior pool increase, preserving finite reserve, unequal requirements and serial reuse. **14 new Lean theorems / 19 declaration audits pass; 94 audits cover the source closure.** Targeted interrupted-formation evidence and a growing-compartment contrast strengthen correspondence without claiming exact copy calibration. [Independent completion review](_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/LIVING-EXPANSION-REVIEW.md#7-final-integration-and-completion-assessment) accepts all seven requirements of the directed goal. [The current theory](theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/LIVING-DEPENDENCIES.md) states the general mechanism-grounded result and its declared coverage; universal eventual reconstruction, all-law derivation and ethical authority remain open. Further applications require appropriate evidence, not a new foundational rule per case.",
      "entry_sha256": "78024d768f7df4e53ebbfbebbbf3cd8bd78698833093c3a22863ae6cc60e8b37"
    },
    {
      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/README.md",
      "entry": "**Living dependencies, general account completed 8 October 2026.** [The current formulation](unified-2026-10-05/LIVING-DEPENDENCIES.md) integrates maintenance, retention/recovery and changing joint provision. [The full-goal audit](../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/LIVING-DEPENDENCY-INTEGRATION.md#12-full-goal-completion-audit) and independent review accept the general account at its declared scope. Fourteen new checked Lean theorems connect disjoint current provision to an actual prior pool increase, with causal evidence and preserved alternatives. This completion does not prove universal eventual reconstruction, derive every physical law or establish ethical authority.",
      "entry_sha256": "eb5ad14f3ea77ad3898350158f6cb11333d143a9d85ecf801e6189335d5bda5a"
    },
    {
      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/GENERATIVE-GROUNDING.md",
      "entry": "**Living dependencies, directed account completed 8 October 2026:** following [Ren’s selected focus](../../../sources/15-codex-theory-conversations/2026-10-07-living-dependencies-current-goal.md), [the general account](LIVING-DEPENDENCIES.md) now joins maintenance, retained organization/recovery and changing joint provision with explicit empirical and formal scope. The latest 14 checked Lean theorems derive bounds from disjoint current assignments and locate actual prior count increases. [The full-goal audit](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/LIVING-DEPENDENCY-INTEGRATION.md#12-full-goal-completion-audit) and independent completion review accept the combined mechanism-grounded explanation. Universal recurrence, all-law derivation and the unified foundation remain distinct unfinished objectives; other authorized research is preserved.",
      "entry_sha256": "40d18acb3471cfe7b8b01c2cf0a90dab442ff838bad6173fa41fc26cf9596eb5"
    },
    {
      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/UNIFIED-ETHICAL-GROUNDING.md",
      "entry": "**Living-dependency account completed at declared scope, 8 October 2026.** Under [Ren’s living focus](../../../sources/15-codex-theory-conversations/2026-10-07-living-dependencies-current-goal.md), [the completed general account](LIVING-DEPENDENCIES.md) explains maintenance, retained/recovered organization and changing joint provision through actual formed conditions and target-specific insufficiency. Its latest 14 checked Lean theorems locate a prior pool increase when disjoint current requirements exceed inherited copies. [Independent completion review](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/LIVING-EXPANSION-REVIEW.md#7-final-integration-and-completion-assessment) accepts the full directed account. This supplies a mechanism-grounded physical connection for situated reasoning; universal eventual renewal and ethical authority are not inferred from it.",
      "entry_sha256": "1103fa64b3508ae8562b6faa01bdcc34b67bc5eceb7ad6728900afae97ce1a37"
    }
  ],
